/-!
# A138106

A triangular sequence of coefficients based on the expansion of a Morse potential type function: p(x,t) = exp(x*t)*(exp(-2*t) - 2*exp(-t)).

The 66 terms known to OEIS, indexed from `1`.

Skeleton generated by `lake exe oeis-gen`; every declaration is a `sorry` placeholder.
-/

namespace A138106

